You can specify an OpenSearch Serverless collection to be included as a conditional element in
your VPC endpoint policy. To do this, see the following example:
JSON
{
"Version":"2012-10-17",
"Statement": [
{
"Effect": "Allow",
"Principal": "*",
"Action": "*",
"Resource": "*",
"Condition": {
"StringEquals": {
"aoss:collection": [
"coll-abc"
]
}
}
}
]
}
Support for aoss:CollectionId is supported.
Condition": {
"StringEquals": {
"aoss:CollectionId": "collection-id"
}
