"Condition": {
"StringEquals": {
"aws:PrincipalTag/Department": [
"Engineering"]
}
}
}
]
}
For more information on using SAML authentication with Amazon OpenSearch Serverless, see
SAML authentication for Amazon OpenSearch Serverless.
You can also include IAM and SAML users in the same VPC endpoint policy. To do this, see the
following example:
JSON
{
"Version":"2012-10-17",
"Statement": [
{
"Effect": "Allow",
"Principal": "*",
"Action": "*",
"Resource": "*",
"Condition": {
"ForAnyValue:StringEquals": {
"saml:cn": [
"saml/111122223333/idp123/group/football",
"saml/111122223333/idp123/group/soccer",
"saml/111122223333/idp123/group/cricket"
]
}
}
},
